Subject: [PATCH 2/3] util/rebuild-bench: P0 benchmark harness

The reproducible benchmark command of delivery-plan phase P0
(doc/engine-first-plan.md): the plan's nine scenarios (cold, unchanged
incremental, clean outputs with retained compiler, and marker edits to a
leaf executable, the frontend, the evaluator, the scheduler, the Verilog
emitter, the Bluesim emitter, and a library source), each measured over
four stages (full cabal build, bsc-executable-only build, library build,
install) with wall time, CPU time, peak RSS, GHC recompilation count and
library package compilation count, plus the toolchain and environment
inventory of P0 item 4. Edits are appended marker comments only, always
restored, and the harness refuses to start on a dirty tree.

Gate: runs on a machine with GHC/cabal and GNU time; this container has
neither, so the numbers come from the first run on real hardware.

